sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户 (Web/APP)
    participant C as 控制器 (Controller)
    participant RS as RecalculationService
    participant AVS as AssetValuationService
    participant HDS as HoldingDerivationService
    participant NS as NavService
    participant XS as XirrService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,DB: ═══ 流程 A：录入证券买卖 → 持仓推导 → 派生落库 → NAV/XIRR 级联 ═══

    U->>C: POST /security-trades {date, securityId, side, quantity, price, fee}
    C->>DB: INSERT security_trades
    C->>RS: recalculateRange(portfolioId, date, date)

    RS->>AVS: persistDerived(portfolioId, date)  %% 自动派生入口

    AVS->>AVS: 查当日 AssetSnapshot 是否已 MANUAL？
    alt 已存在 MANUAL → 跳过自动派生（REG-03）
        AVS-->>RS: 跳过（保留手工值）
    else 否则计算 DERIVED
        AVS->>HDS: deriveAll(portfolioId, date)
        loop 每个证券
            HDS->>DB: SELECT security_trades WHERE portfolioId, securityId, date<=?
            HDS->>DB: SELECT security_prices WHERE securityId, asOf<=?（向前沿用）
            HDS-->>AVS: Position[]（数量/均价/市值）
        end
        AVS->>DB: SELECT cash_balances WHERE asOf<=?（独立，向前沿用）
        AVS-->>AVS: totalAsset = Σ市值 + cashBalance
        AVS->>DB: INSERT asset_snapshots ... ON CONFLICT(portfolioId,date) WHERE source='DERIVED' DO UPDATE
        Note right of DB: 双保险：不覆盖 MANUAL（REG-02/REG-04）
        DB-->>AVS: AssetSnapshot(DERIVED)
    end

    AVS-->>RS: done
    RS->>NS: calculateNavForDate(portfolioId, date)  %% 同事务顺序
    NS->>DB: SELECT asset_snapshots(终值) + prev daily_nav
    NS->>DB: UPSERT daily_nav
    NS-->>RS: NavResult

    RS->>XS: calculateXirrForDate(portfolioId, date)
    XS->>DB: SELECT cashflows(<=date) + asset_snapshots(终值)
    XS->>XS: Newton-Raphson（阈值 1e-7，rate≤-0.999 钳制）
    XS->>DB: UPSERT daily_xirr(xirrValue DECIMAL(20,8))
    XS-->>RS: xirrValue?

    RS-->>C: {affectedDates:1}
    C-->>U: 200 {code:0, data: securityTrade}

    Note over U,DB: ═══ 流程 B（T5）：手工覆盖 / 重置 双路径 —— 快照层仅当日 + 计算层级联至今日 ═══

    U->>C: POST /snapshots {date, totalAsset, marketValue?, cashBalance?, note?}
    C->>AVS: upsertManual(portfolioId, date, dto)
    AVS->>DB: INSERT asset_snapshots ... ON CONFLICT(portfolioId,date) DO UPDATE (source=MANUAL)
    Note right of DB: 无条件覆盖，含原 DERIVED 行（REG-03 手工优先）<br/>快照层：仅当日一行，不做 DERIVED 区间重建
    DB-->>AVS: AssetSnapshot(MANUAL, valuationFlag=MANUAL_INPUT)
    AVS-->>C: snapshot(MANUAL)
    C->>RS: recalculateNavRange(portfolioId, date)  %% 🔴 同事务，不可省（REG-06）
    RS->>DB: SELECT DISTINCT date FROM asset_snapshots WHERE date BETWEEN date AND today
    loop 快照日期集合升序逐日（份额链条依赖前日）
        RS->>NS: calculateNavForDate → UPSERT daily_nav
        RS->>XS: calculateXirrForDate → UPSERT daily_xirr
    end
    RS-->>C: {recalculatedDays: N}
    C-->>U: 200 {data: snapshot(MANUAL), meta:{recalculatedDays:N}}

    U->>C: POST /snapshots/:date/reset  %% 撤销手工 → 回退 DERIVED
    C->>AVS: resetToDerived(portfolioId, date)
    AVS->>AVS: computeDerived(portfolioId, date)  %% 纯计算，不落库
    AVS->>DB: UPSERT asset_snapshots (原地覆盖该行, source=DERIVED, valuationFlag=计算结果, note=NULL)
    Note right of DB: 🔴 不是 DELETE + persistDerived —— 若该日非事件日，<br/>先删再派生会导致该行彻底消失（PRD SNAP-P0-07 验收 1）
    AVS-->>C: snapshot(DERIVED)
    C->>RS: recalculateNavRange(portfolioId, date)  %% 🔴 同事务，不可省（REG-06）
    RS-->>C: {recalculatedDays: N}
    C-->>U: 200 {data: snapshot(DERIVED), meta:{recalculatedDays:N}}

    U->>C: DELETE /snapshots/:id  %% 删除某日记录
    C->>AVS: deleteRecord(portfolioId, date)
    AVS->>DB: DELETE FROM asset_snapshots WHERE portfolioId, date
    alt date ∈ 事件日集合
        AVS->>AVS: persistDerived(portfolioId, date)  %% 立即回填 DERIVED（Q-B17）
    else 非事件日
        AVS-->>AVS: 该日留空，读取时前值填充
    end
    C->>RS: recalculateNavRange(portfolioId, date)  %% 🔴 同事务，不可省（REG-06）
    RS-->>C: {recalculatedDays: N}
    C-->>U: 200 {data: null, meta:{recalculatedDays:N}}

    Note over U,DB: ═══ 区间重建（批量）：DELETE ... AND source='DERIVED' + INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING ═══
    U->>C: POST /recalculate {startDate, endDate?}
    C->>RS: recalculateRange(portfolioId, start, end?)
    RS->>RS: end ?? today；getEventDates() = 出入金/买卖/现价/余额 事件日 ∪ 区间端点
    RS->>DB: DELETE FROM asset_snapshots WHERE portfolioId AND date IN(事件日) AND source='DERIVED'
    RS->>AVS: persistDerived(date) 逐事件日（事件日稀疏落库 + 读前值填充）
    RS->>RS: recalculateNavRange(portfolioId, start, today)
    Note right of RS: 🔴 第 ③ 步用「快照日期集合」而非「事件日集合」<br/>= SELECT DISTINCT date FROM asset_snapshots<br/>（含手工记录日，否则漏算并中断份额链条）
    RS->>NS: 逐日计算 NAV（升序，依赖前日份额）
    RS->>XS: 逐日计算 XIRR
    RS-->>C: {affectedDates: N}
